{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crunch Element</strong> is a <strong>tactical VR shooter</strong> where you breach, blast, and clear destructible compounds using explosive gadgets, high-powered weapons, and precision tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or co-op with up to 4 players. Plan your raid, choose your loadout, and enter enemy compounds where <strong>no wall is safe</strong> and every mission plays out in <strong>destructible environments</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1090250/extras/38b48415af23465d9d1155ecad3a1a8b.avif?t=1751482822\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After nearly a year of rebuilding, Crunch Element has been fully reworked with new systems, enemies, and gear based on reviews and feedback. The foundation is set for continuous updates, new contracts, and new missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The old version of the game has been moved to the \u201clegacy\u201d branch.</strong> To access it: <strong>Steam Library \u2192 Right-click Crunch Element \u2192 Properties \u2192 Betas \u2192 Select legacy from the dropdown.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1090250/extras/d286d863619fcd76fc01fbd13f3da6e6.poster.avif?t=1751482822\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1090250/extras/d286d863619fcd76fc01fbd13f3da6e6.webm?t=1751482822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1090250/extras/d286d863619fcd76fc01fbd13f3da6e6.mp4?t=1751482822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1090250/extras/d3dac2915a2001dfa065e3063250a2dd.poster.avif?t=1751482822\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1090250/extras/d3dac2915a2001dfa065e3063250a2dd.webm?t=1751482822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1090250/extras/d3dac2915a2001dfa065e3063250a2dd.mp4?t=1751482822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Destructible Environments</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breach walls, blast doors, and reshape the battlefield.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gunfire, explosives, and even melee tools carve through enemy defenses.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tactical FPS Combat in VR</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use realistic weapons and physics-driven interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between loud and aggressive or quiet and stealthy.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Co-op Multiplayer (1\u20134 Players)</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join friends or go solo on contracts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synchronize breaches, watch each other\u2019s backs, or split up for multi-angle assaults.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Contract-Based Mission System</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play structured multi-stage missions with objectives, side contracts, and unlock rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through fortified outposts, arctic labs, and underground bunkers controlled by a fanatical enemy faction.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Smart Enemy AI</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies investigate, coordinate, take cover, and call out threats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alert states shift dynamically between stealth and combat, changing enemy behavior and music in real-time.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gear Up. Get Tactical.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize Your Loadout</strong> \u2013 Unlock and equip powerful gear, weapons, armor, and mods.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Tools</strong> \u2013 Scanner attachments, missile headsets, remote turrets, keycards, and hacking stations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Explosives</strong> \u2013 Timer-activated charges, breaching hammers, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Streamlined Ammo System</strong> \u2013 New pouch-based inventory with faster access and better management.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immerse Yourself</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Security Cameras &amp; Systems</strong> \u2013 Hack enemy tech or be spotted and hunted.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New UI, Sound, &amp; Visual Effects</strong> \u2013 Full overhaul of the HUD, audio mix, and destruction visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Transmissions</strong> \u2013 NPCs communicate mission events and story through real-time voice transmissions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cosmetic Unlocks</strong> \u2013 Armor, helmets, and hats for operator flair.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ongoing Development</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crunch Element is under <strong>active development</strong> with regular updates and new content. The <strong>Overhaul Update</strong> is just the beginning\u2014with future contracts, enemy factions, and game modes already in the works.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Play now.<br>\ud83d\udd39 Blow things up.<br>\ud83d\udd39 And help shape the future of Crunch Element.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1090250/extras/945e681bdf60843225af0417636117c1.avif?t=1751482822\" width=630 height=210 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1090250?t=1751482822","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1090250?t=1751482822","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1090250/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751482822","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1090250/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751482822","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crunch Element</strong> is a <strong>tactical VR shooter</strong> where you breach, blast, and clear destructible compounds using explosive gadgets, high-powered weapons, and precision tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or co-op with up to 4 players. Plan your raid, choose your loadout, and enter enemy compounds where <strong>no wall is safe</strong> and every mission plays out in <strong>destructible environments</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1090250/extras/38b48415af23465d9d1155ecad3a1a8b.avif?t=1751482822\" width=800 he