nts</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breach walls, blast doors, and reshape the battlefield.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gunfire, explosives, and even melee tools carve through enemy defenses.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tactical FPS Combat in VR</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use realistic weapons and physics-driven interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between loud and aggressive or quiet and stealthy.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Co-op Multiplayer (1\u20134 Players)</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join friends or go solo on contracts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synchronize breaches, watch each other\u2019s backs, or split up for multi-angle assaults.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Contract-Based Mission System</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play structured multi-stage missions with objectives, side contracts, and unlock rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through fortified outposts, arctic labs, and underground bunkers controlled by a fanatical enemy faction.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Smart Enemy AI</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies investigate, coordinate, take cover, and call out threats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alert states shift dynamically between stealth and combat, changing enemy behavior and music in real-time.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gear Up. Get Tactical.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize Your Loadout</strong> \u2013 Unlock and equip powerful gear, weapons, armor, and mods.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Tools</strong> \u2013 Scanner attachments, missile headsets, remote turrets, keycards, and hacking stations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Explosives</strong> \u2013 Timer-activated charges, breaching hammers, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Streamlined Ammo System</strong> \u2013 New pouch-based inventory with faster access and better management.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immerse Yourself</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Security Cameras &amp; Systems</strong> \u2013 Hack enemy tech or be spotted and hunted.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New UI, Sound, &amp; Visual Effects</strong> \u2013 Full overhaul of the HUD, audio mix, and destruction visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Transmissions</strong> \u2013 NPCs communicate mission events and story through real-time voice transmissions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cosmetic Unlocks</strong> \u2013 Armor, helmets, and hats for operator flair.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ongoing Development</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crunch Element is under <strong>active development</strong> with regular updates and new content. The <strong>Overhaul Update</strong> is just the beginning\u2014with future contracts, enemy factions, and game modes already in the works.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Play now.<br>\ud83d\udd39 Blow things up.<br>\ud83d\udd39 And help shape the future of Crunch Element.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1090250/extras/945e681bdf60843225af0417636117c1.avif?t=1751482822\" width=630 height=210 /></span></p>","developers":["Dreamlab XR"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1090250/c880513089857a37840ca05e9f25a7b5cdcd31fd/header.jpg?t=1751482822","is_free":false,"